.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="The 1-D discrete Laplacian tridiag(-1, 2, -1) of size n has eigenvalues 2 - 2 cos(j pi / (n + 1)). Lanczos iteration (through ARPACK) finds a handful of them using only matrix-vector products. In shift-invert mode it handles a sparse n = 100 000 instance, where a dense eigensolver would need 80 GB just to store the matrix.">

